{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879130/extras/876d40f9cfc792e006cba28093bd2d5d.avif?t=1756134017\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Each floor possesses a compactor room. Remove anything that you find inside of it</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll be tackling one of the apartment complexes<i> of<strong> BLOC C</strong></i>, a festering obelisk of brick and plaster that houses the worst of the worst. At least, that's how any average <i>Eckhart Citizen</i> would describe it.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879130/extras/7e26165a7afe677195007f9f0542e02d.avif?t=1756134017\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Repel enemies as you ascend the building so you can continue your work</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After <i>The Haze</i>, life changed in ways humanity couldn't have imagined.\u00a0<strong><i>Anglers</i></strong>\u00a0are chief among them. Little is known about these phantoms save for their unrelenting desire to erase us. Thankfully,\u00a0<i>Eckhart Resources &amp; Acquisitions</i> has leveraged their proprietary technology to make existence possible again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879130/extras/0c84b7803eec65d97ccc1e75bcd84618.avif?t=1756134017\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Conversate with tenants and learn more about the world</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hundred floors is no small feat. Throughout your shift, you'll come across people . Those compactor rooms full of trash will still be there in a few minutes; There's no rush.\u00a0</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Starting Out","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3879130/25cadbc53d1739fbc0cedbe09f2a6b5aaafd990e.jpg"},{"name":"Finding Your Stride","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3879130/c85a27bf9ee239b3690162cb7257bc33799c6701.jpg"},{"name":"In The Zone","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3879130/27020ba1bbec828fffc018b015aff76c5862bca1.jpg"},{"name":"On a Roll","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3879130/427cd87e08958727f02876ed888b04d485167319.jpg"},{"name":"All in a Day's Work","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3879130/5c6d128fcf80b2493f42d63715f8bc4d15b8c692.jpg"}],"total":5},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3879130?t=1756134017","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3879130?t=1756134017","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879130/18c4fb84c67a2f00b434a998dbd130596b70b46f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756134017","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879130/18c4fb84c67a2f00b434a998dbd130596b70b46f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756134017","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879130/extras/876d40f9cfc792e006cba28093bd2d5d.avif?t=1756134017\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Each floor possesses a compactor room. Remove anything that you find inside of it</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" 